      <title>[Journal Club] The Landscape of Agentic Reinforcement Learning for LLMs: A Survey</title>
      <link>https://shunk031.me/event/the-landscape-of-agentic-reinforcement-learning-for-llms-a-survey/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 01 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0900</pubDate>
